 "_comment": "THE RECEIPT MUST REACH A DOUBLED PLAN RUN. Every other plan fixture here is `algorithm: stepped`, and that is exactly why the defect this fixture exists for survived: run_info's plan keys sat inside observability.cpp's `if (info.stepped_present)` block, which is FALSE on a doubled run. Four of #354's six published arms are doubled, so on his own jobs the run printed every plan number on stderr and the receipt carried none of them -- no anystep_cells, no plan_solid_remainder_mm3, no plan_by_region, no plan_rho_queries_*, and not even the outline beam's four numbers. Found by reading his run_info, not the code. Two sizes on the halving ladder and two groups, so the per-group receipt is exercised rather than just present.",
